  "title": "Three ways Atlassian’s Learning Team uses AI, and one way they won’t",
  "summary": "The best way to get value out of AI is to scale at the team level, but while 85% of workers use AI, only 29% have embedded it into team workflows. The Atlassian Learning Team is in that 29%, and the lessons they’ve learned are a model for teams of all types. They shared three […]",
